                        "Multiplying by $4$: $2x + y = 4 \\implies 2x + y - 4 = 0$."
                    ],
                    "finalAnswer": "(c)",
                    "options": [
                        "(a) $x + 2y = 5$",
                        "(b) $x - y + 1 = 0$",
                        "(c) $2x + y - 4 = 0$",
                        "(d) $2x - y = 0$"
                    ]
                },
