                        "Substituting $p^2$: $\\frac{2}{a^2 + b^2} = \\frac{a^2 + b^2}{a^2 b^2} \\implies (a^2 + b^2)^2 = 2a^2 b^2 \\implies a^2 + b^2 = \\sqrt{2}ab$.",
